# SPA fallback for clean paths.
#
# The app uses real paths (/table, /team/choakers-fc) rather than hash routes,
# so a refresh or a shared link makes the host request a path that has no file
# behind it. This rule serves index.html for anything unknown and lets React
# Router take over.
#
# Honoured by both Netlify and Cloudflare Pages. Vite copies this from
# client/public/ into dist/ automatically — no build config needed.
#
# For Vercel, see client/vercel.json instead.

/*    /index.html   200